        "reference": "Helaman 8:13",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, did he not bear record that the Son of God should come? And as he lifted up the brazen serpent in the wilderness, even so shall he be lifted up who should come.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 71,
            "end": 80,
